# Dream About Me

- Next.js 15 Pages Router + App Router API routes
- React 19, TypeScript, pnpm
- Tailwind only when it is already there; the product look lives in `dream.module.css`
- Do not redesign the UI
- Do not add features unless asked
- Do not use email / OAuth / password fields
- Do not store the raw 3-emoji private key on `profiles`
- Do not touch Gettles/Glog/Firebase
- `pnpm dev` is port 3001. Do not kill port 3000.
- `@vercel/analytics` lives in `pages/_app.tsx`. Do not add another `<Analytics />`.
